{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42230","headline":"回至瓜洲献侍中 · 徐铉","name":"回至瓜洲献侍中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫微垣里旧宾从，来向吴门谒府公。\n奉使谬持严助节，登门初识鲁王宫。\n笙歌隐隐违离後，烟水茫茫怅望中。\n日暮瓜洲江北岸，两行情泪滴西风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}